WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.071
Load it to scale.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:10.985
Enter a target weight. The bar is drawn to scale. You see the plates for each side. You also see if the weight is exact.

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:16.449
Step by one kilo. Switch the bar weight. It shows exactly what your plates make.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.405
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
